# Security headers (PHI-46, PRD §11.4). Served by Cloudflare Pages.
# The script-src hash pins the site's ONE inline script:
#   GPoKB… = the FR-08 theme snippet (Shell.astro, every page)
# If it changes, recompute sha256(base64) of the exact built
# <script> body across dist/**/*.html (csp-hashes.test.ts checks this).
# static.cloudflareinsights.com = the Web Analytics beacon Cloudflare
# injects at the edge (PHI-161). Host, not file path: the beacon URL
# carries a version suffix. It reports to this domain, so connect-src
# stays 'self'.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-GPoKBNhT59nkFtJSv49GJPwxuKMFId3KuVUZ5AmqxZA=' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; media-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
